<p><strong>Obtaining all odd bits</strong><br>
<!-- -->Similarly, to obtain all the odd bits of n, we can use a mask with =
all odd bit positions are set to 1:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
